{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01620","headline":"杂曲歌辞 君子有所思行 一 · 僧贯休","name":"杂曲歌辞 君子有所思行 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"我爱正考甫，思贤作商颂。\n我爱扬子云，理乱皆如凤。\n振衣中夜起，露花香旖旎。\n扑碎骊龙明月珠，敲出凤凰五色髓。\n陋卷萧萧风淅淅，缅想斯人胜珪璧。\n寂寥千载不相逢，无限区区尽虚掷。\n君不见沈约道，佳人不在兹，春光爲谁惜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"僧贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01620.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01620","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}